  description: "You can Ritual Summon this card with a \"Clown Crew\" card. You can
    reveal this card in your hand; add 1 \"Clown Crew\" card from your Deck to your
    hand, except a Ritual Monster, then discard 1 card. You can only use this effect
    of \"Clown Crew Flair\" once per turn. If this card is Tributed: You can activate
    1 of these effects (but you can only use each of these effects of \"Clown Crew
    Flair\" once per turn);\r\n\u25CF Shuffle all Ritual Monsters from the field
    and the GYs into the Deck.\r\n\u25CF Change 1 Effect Monster on the field to
    face-down Defense Position."
